              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku yairiire omumaisho hakye, yaareeba abandi babiri enyineemwe, Yakobo mwene Zebedaayo, na Yohaana omurumuna, abaabaire bari omu bwato nibashumikanisa obutimba; nabo yaabeeta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
