              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahabw'ebyo okurangaanwa kwe kwabuga omuri Siria yoona, abaabaire bakwatsirwe endwara ezitari zimwe, n'okuhururwa, n'abaabaire bariho baadaimoni, n'abarikugwa entsimbo, n'abazingazingirwe; kandi yaabakiza. ",
          "type": "text",
